<v Daniel>massive server infrastructure or complex zero-day exploits.</v>

7
00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:49.126
<v Maya>Which are those rare software bugs the manufacturer doesn't even know exist yet.</v>

8
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:56.958
<v Daniel>Right, exactly. If you saw those things, investigators instantly knew that a nation state with incredibly deep pockets was behind it. I mean, it was practically binary.</v>

9
00:00:57.308 --> 00:01:03.031
