10
00:01:03.051 --> 00:01:03.731
<v Daniel>Completely broken.</v>

11
00:01:04.132 --> 00:01:14.137
<v Maya>We are looking at a threat landscape that has completely decoupled capability from resources. So today's deep dive focuses on a brand new, frankly, bombshell document. It</v>

12
00:01:14.177 --> 00:01:14.777
