14
00:01:23.732 --> 00:01:24.332
<v Daniel>Just recently.</v>

15
00:01:24.372 --> 00:01:30.797
<v Maya>Yeah. And it covers activity they detected and disrupted between December 2025 and August 2026.</v>

16
00:01:31.577 --> 00:01:36.741
<v Daniel>And to really make sense of what this report is telling us, we're also pulling from a whole stack of supporting research today.</v>

17
00:01:37.021 --> 00:01:47.428
