32
00:03:25.443 --> 00:03:40.356
<v Daniel>We aren't talking about a chatbot writing emails anymore. We are talking about AI models running in harnesses, working at machine speed. Yeah. These are agentic workflows where models are parallel processing tasks, reacting to real-time</v>

